631	      // onIncrement straight to setQuantity (bypassing the real mutation call entirely - the
632	      // exact wrong shortcut this wrapper exists to avoid) would also satisfy both the
633	      // not.toThrow() check above and the setQuantity check below, since setQuantity(3) still
